OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FThe Scintilla Orchestra, conducted
OL,7,     Fby Riccardo Minasi presents a
OL,8,     Fprogramme of playful, witty and
OL,9,     Fcharming Italian and German music
OL,10,     Ffrom the 17th century.
OL,11,G0630 Breakfast
OL,12,     FTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,16,     FIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,17,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,18,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,19,     Fwith familiar favourites.
