OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FAl Ryan celebrates summer
OL,7,     Fmusic-making in the UK and beyond,
OL,8,     Fincluding the BBC Philharmonic
OL,9,     FOrchestra and Philharmonia Chorus
OL,10,     Fperforming Beethoven's mighty
OL,11,     F'Choral' Symphony.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Handel
OL,13,     F4/5. Donald Macleod delves into
OL,14,     FHandel's relationship with the
OL,15,     FBritish royal family, from
OL,16,     Fcoronations to court rivalries and
OL,17,     Fshifts in patronage.
OL,18,G1700 In Tune
OL,19,     FPianist Ethan Loch plays live.
OL,20,     FLiam Steel and George Jackson on
OL,21,     FDie Fledermaus.
